round floor features a spacious and light-filled living and dining area with direct access to the sunny terrace and private garden. The modern fitted kitchen is fully equipped and complemented by a practical pantry.\n\nThe house offers two fully equipped bathrooms, with a bathtub and two showers, ensuring a high level of comfort for multiple occupants.\n\nA particular highlight is the fully developed basement, providing additional versatile space that can be used as a home office, gym or guest area.\n\nKey features:\n\nBuilt in 2021 (new construction)\nApprox. 117 sqm living space\nUnderfloor heating throughout the house\nEnergy-efficient heat pump\nPhotovoltaic system\nHigh-quality real wood flooring\nFully equipped modern kitchen with pantry\nTwo bathrooms (bathtub and shower)\nFully finished basement\nPrivate garden with large terrace\nGarage and additional parking space\nFully furnished – ready to move in\n\nThe property is offered as an all-inclusive rental, covering utilities, heating, electricity and internet, ensuring maximum convenience with no additional administrative effort.\n\nLocation:\nNeufahrn near Freising offers excellent connections to Munich city center as well as Munich Airport. The area is known for its quiet, family-friendly environment combined with good local infrastructure, shopping facilities and access to public transportation.","facilities":{"airConditioning":{"value":"no"},"allergyFriendly":{"value":"no"},"balconyTerrace":{"value":"private"},"basement":{"value":"private"},"bathroom":{"value":"private"},"bed":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomFurnished":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomLock":{"value":"yes"},"bedrooms":{"value":"3"},"closet":{"value":"yes"},"couplesAllowed":{"value":"yes"},"desk":{"value":"yes"},"dishwasher":{"value":"yes"},"dryer":{"value":"yes"},"electricityCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"flooring":{"value":"wood"},"garden":{"value":"private"},"gasCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"heating":{"value":"electrical"},"internetCostIncluded":{"value